  "limits": [
    "Internal beginNative / resident start owner integrated; normal bind stays passive and mode=native remains gated until subsequent ring/display owners.",
    "Firmware-ready requires actual mailbox/fence acknowledgements; device-ready additionally requires subsequent GMC/IH, engine and display owners.",
    "Host tests synthesize hardware responses in RAM, including real SDK MMIO/PCI/boot-hold adapters; no physical GPU execution is claimed.",
    "The DCN guard proves an unchanged linear uncompressed boot scanout; it does not implement a modeset or recover changed training/timing/routing.",
    "GPU wait failure retains outstanding requests, TMR, mappings and boot exclusion; explicit retry observes late completion without claiming a reset.",
    "GC/SDMA command processors stay parked until 0.80.10/11; VCN/DMCU/optional TAs belong to their later IP owners.",
    "PSP10 has no Mode1 reset or RLC autoload; platform firmware supplies SOS/SMU.",
    "Prior 0.80.7 SMP4 evidence covers common memory contracts separately; unchanged Kernel/SDK/Contract were not rebuilt.",
    "Physical laptop tests only in 0.80.39."
